        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ūmala ū kūbeeja pyī ī milīmo īyo wabeejaga kūlwa hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, hūna ūshenha moi ī shikolo īsho ise Daūdi walī washifunya kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA; ī feza nī zahabu nī shikolo ī shingī pyī ī shose. Ūshitūūla ū mu chumba sha kūtūūlīla sabo īsho shalī ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isandīko kwenhwa mu hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Solomoni ūbalagīja pye a banamhala ba Isilaeli bibilinge mu Yelusalemu kūlī we ī, pye na a batongeeji ba ng'anda, na a bataale ba ndūgū ja Isilaeli; balībūūche ī lisandīko lya būlagane lya ng'wa SEEBA balīnje ī Sayuni ū mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi, balītwaale Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana pye a bagosha ba Isilaeli biza ū kūlī ntemi, bibilinga hamò ng'wikanza lya shigukulu sha ng'weji gwa mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika pye a banamhala ba Isilaeli, a Balawī būlībūūcha ī lisandīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji na a Balawī h'abo bakalībūūcha ī lisandīko nī liheema lya kwibilingīla, pye nī shiseme sheela īsho shalī ū ng'wiheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Solomoni na a banhū pye abo baalī biza kūlī we, walī hamò nabo ū kū būtongi w'isandīko, bakūfunyaga shitambò sha ng'holo na ng'ombe ningī no; ndūhū wa kūdūla kūshiisaaba nūūlū kūshibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bagabīji būlīshisha ī lisandīko lya būlagane lya ng'wa SEEBA a h'ipandī lyalyo, ī lipandī lyeela ū mu gatī ya hekalu, ī lipandī lyeela no no no; būshika būlītūūla ha sīlīlī ya manana ga makelubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A makelubi gaalī gagambile a manana gago a higūlya y'ipandī lya kūtūūlwa ī lisandīko, gūlīfīkīja ī lisandīko nī mitī yalyo ya kūlībūūkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitī yenīyo yalī milīhu, yamanikaga ūlū munhū alī ng'wipandī lyeela, ū kū būtongi walyo ī lipandī ī lyeela no no no; gwike yaya ū kwībona ūlū ūlī hanze yalyo ī lipandī lyeela; ī mitī yenīyo ītaalī ho kūshisha nī lelo īyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wisandīko shalī shitīmo shikolo shingī shose shose, ūlū ītī a mabalala ga mawe ayo akagatūūla moi Musa aho balī Holebu, ikanza īlo SEEBA akabeeja būlagane nabo a Baisilaeli aho bafumaga Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bagabīji būfuma ū ng'wipandī lyeela. A bagabīji abo baalīho a henaho baalī batasolanhyiwe kūlondeela magele gabo; a bose baalī baamala kwiyeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī abo baalī bīmbi ba mīmbo, a ba Asafu, Hemani, Yedusuni, na a bitūnja babo a bose, hamò na a badūgū babo, bīmīīla kū lwandī lwa kīya lwa ng'walīlo. Baalī bazwalile shizwalo sha kitaani yawiza, kūnū bakūtūlaga nzege, ndono na malimba. Baalī hamò na bagabīji igana na makūmi abīlī bakūfuulaga mhembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bafuuji ba mhembe na a bīmbi bahelelekejaga n'ilaka ifuuku lya būsangī būmò bakūnkumīlījaga na kūnūmba ū SEEBA. Bahīlīīlaga no bakūngongoolaga ū SEEBA, kūnū nī mhembe nī nzege, nī shikolo ī shingī shikūlīlaga. Bīmbaga bakūhayaga, “Alī wawiza no, ū būtogwa wakwe būlī wa welelo na welelo!” Hūn'ilunde lyūyookaja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a bagabīji būlemeelwa ū kūbeeja ī milīmo yabo kūlw'ilunde lyenīlo, nguno ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA līkayookaja ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
